  "description": "Your Everyday Companion for More Comfortable Rides.\n\nThe E11EVEN WINGMAN Step-Thru Electric Bike is designed for riders who need comfort, convenience, and extra carrying capability in their daily adventures. Featuring a low-step frame, powerful 500W motor, long-range 48V battery, and a heavy-duty rear rack, WINGMAN is built for commuting, errands, family rides, and everyday exploration.\n\nWith its compact 20\" × 3.3 anti-puncture tires, front suspension, and hydraulic disc brakes, WINGMAN delivers a smooth and confident riding experience while maintaining excellent stability and practicality.\n\nKey Features\n\n⚡ 500W Powerful Motor\nEnjoy responsive acceleration and reliable power with speeds up to 28 MPH, perfect for daily commuting and recreational riding.\n\n🔋 Long-Range Battery\nEquipped with a 48V 15Ah battery, WINGMAN delivers up to 70 miles of range for longer rides with fewer charging stops.\n\n🚲 Step-Thru Easy Access Design\nThe low-step aluminum frame makes mounting and dismounting easier while providing a comfortable upright riding position.\n\n📦 Heavy-Duty Rear Cargo Rack\nDesigned for everyday practicality, the rear rack supports up to 55 lbs, giving you extra space for groceries, gear, or personal belongings.\n\n🛡️ Smooth & Safe Riding Experience\nThe 60mm front suspension fork, anti-puncture tires, and hydraulic disc brakes help provide comfort, stability, and reliable control on different road conditions.\n\n⚙️ Shimano® 7-Speed Gear System\nAdjust your riding experience with a reliable Shimano® 7-speed drivetrain for different terrains and riding preferences.",
